          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "While comparing percentages, we have to be mindful that we are comparing fractions or proportions and not absolute values."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.383,
            0.845,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ A provision store is offering a stock clearance sale. Customers can choose one of the two options — 20% discount or ₹50 discount—for any purchase above ₹150. Which option would you choose if you want to:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.443,
            0.418,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) buy items worth ₹180"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.467,
            0.417,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) buy items worth ₹225"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.491,
            0.418,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) buy items worth ₹300"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.521,
            0.587,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 12:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A bakery called Cakely is offering a 30% + 20% discount on all cakes. Another bakery called Cakify is offering a 50% discount on all cakes. Would you rather choose Cakely or Cakify if you want the cheaper cost?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.616,
            0.507,
            0.797,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.616,
                0.507,
                0.797,
                0.661
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_25_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.637,
            0.59,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "It seems that both the options should give the same benefit. Although mathematically 30% + 20% is the same as 50%, the usage of 30% + 20% in shopping means compounding. Suppose you want to buy a cake worth 200. Suppose you want to buy a cake worth ₹200."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.716,
            0.586,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Cakely’s 30% + 20% →"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.762,
            0.593,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Applying the 30% discount → the price of cake is ₹200 – ₹60 = ₹140."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.799,
            0.593,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Applying the 20% discount on ₹140 → the price of cake is ₹140 – ₹28 = ₹112."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.84,
            0.305,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Cakify’s 50% →"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.864,
            0.594,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The 50% discount makes the price of the cake ₹100."
            }
          ]
        },
